        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 2:13",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold I do not mean the end of the book of Helaman, but I mean the end of the book of Nephi, from which I have taken all the account which I have written.",
